# {{.Name}}

## Development

```text
arasy dev ./wasm       # browser at :8080, rebuilds when you reload the page
arasy run ./native     # native window
arasy dev -p native    # native window, rebuilds when you press Enter
```

## Shipping

```text
arasy build ./wasm              # a directory to host
arasy build -p native ./native  # an executable for this machine
```

The native entry point needs a C toolchain, because GLFW is cgo. Without one
it drops out of the build and the other entry points still compile; run
`arasy doctor -p native ./native` to see what is missing.

Run `go mod tidy` once after generating the project.
